WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.239
Stuck on a Word Hunt board?

2
00:00:02.259 --> 00:00:04.168
Let's find every word, fast!

3
00:00:04.188 --> 00:00:06.860
Just head to wordhuntsolvers.com.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.398
Start with a 4x4 grid.

5
00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:13.754
Type each letter right where it sits on your game board.

6
00:00:13.774 --> 00:00:16.930
The cursor jumps ahead for you, so it's quick!

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.014
Now hit Solve.

8
00:00:22.034 --> 00:00:22.384
Boom!

9
00:00:22.404 --> 00:00:25.561
Every word, longest first, with its points.

10
00:00:25.581 --> 00:00:27.680
50 words on this board!

11
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.167
Got a bigger board?

12
00:00:29.187 --> 00:00:32.210
Tap Clear, then set rows and columns to 5.

13
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.050
Type in your new letters, same as before.

14
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.519
Hit Solve again.

15
00:00:41.539 --> 00:00:42.480
123 words!

16
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.170
The top one is worth 2,200 points.

17
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.840
Now it's your turn!
